    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dylio's Adventures</strong> is a <strong>Casual</strong> game of the <strong>Rogue Runner</strong> genre with \u201cToy\u201d aesthetics, in which we control a peculiar Armadillo named <strong>Dylio</strong> who must overcome countless obstacles along interdimensional paths, to recover what a\u00a0<strong>Crow</strong> has snatched from him, and thus be able to return home without perishing in the attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/08d2a001a178592e3986a270c5740fa9.poster.avif?t=1748197070\" width=750 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/08d2a001a178592e3986a270c5740fa9.webm?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/08d2a001a178592e3986a270c5740fa9.mp4?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through strange portals that change Dylio's shape, obtaining new abilities that allow you to avoid obstacles and activate intricate mechanisms to be able to overcome the different levels and explore new worlds, or try to beat your record in the endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/b4a1d3b8cdfbffdb0c9080c9b54a4e31.poster.avif?t=1748197070\" width=750 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/b4a1d3b8cdfbffdb0c9080c9b54a4e31.webm?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/b4a1d3b8cdfbffdb0c9080c9b54a4e31.mp4?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dylio's Adventures</strong> is a <strong>Casual</strong> game of the <strong>Rogue Runner</strong> genre with \u201cToy\u201d aesthetics, in which we control a peculiar Armadillo named <strong>Dylio</strong> who must overcome countless obstacles along interdimensional paths, to recover what a\u00a0<strong>Crow</strong> has snatched from him, and thus be able to return home without perishing in the attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/08d2a001a178592e3986a270c5740fa9.poster.avif?t=1748197070\" width=750 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/08d2a001a178592e3986a270c5740fa9.webm?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/08d2a001a178592e3986a270c5740fa9.mp4?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through strange portals that change Dylio's shape, obtaining new abilities that allow you to avoid obstacles and activate intricate mechanisms to be able to overcome the different levels and explore new worlds, or try to beat your record in the endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/b4a1d3b8cdfbffdb0c9080c9b54a4e31.poster.avif?t=1748197070\" width=750 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/b4a1d3b8cdfbffdb0c9080c9b54a4e31.webm?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493880/extras/b4a1d3b8cdfbffdb0c9080c9b54a4e31.mp4?t=1748197070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
